Alembic database migrations for CyberSentinel.

Common commands (run from the backend/ directory):

  # Create a new migration after changing models
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe your change"

  # Apply all pending migrations
  alembic upgrade head

  # Roll back one migration
  alembic downgrade -1

  # Show current migration state
  alembic current

Note: For development, the app auto-creates tables on startup via init_db.py.
Alembic is used for incremental schema changes in staging/production.
